ments, or launch data only when they help explain the decision. A concise coach-observation version can stand on its own."]],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"What does the golfer receive?"],["P",{},"A private, coach-branded roadmap showing their goal, starting point, priority barriers, development phases, recommended first phase, connected package, and clear next choices."]],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"Does Roadmap handle booking or payment?"],["P",{},"No. Add the booking, purchase, or contact link you already use. Roadmap explains the recommendation and then hands the golfer to that process."]],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"Is this for academies or multi-coach facilities?"],["P",{},"The first release is for one independent instructor. Shared team administration and academy-wide reporting are outside this version."]],["DETAILS",{},["SUMMARY",{},"When will I see the price?"],["P",{},"The exact price, recurrence, and complete terms will be shown in Canadian dollars before any paid choice. Nothing on this page creates a charge."]]]]],["SECTION",{"class":"final-cta","aria-labelledby":"final-heading"},["DIV",{"class":"page-width final-cta-inner"},["P",{"class":"eyebrow eyebrow-light"},"Your next assessment can become a clearer plan."],["H2",{"id":"final-heading"},"Start with one golfer and one package."],["P",{},"Bring your coaching judgment. Roadmap helps you shape, preview, and share the story around it."],["A",{"class":"button button-light","href":"/auth/login?return_to=%2Fapp"},"Start your first roadmap",["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true"},"→"]]]]],["FOOTER",{"class":"site-footer"},["DIV",{"class":"page-width footer-grid"},["DIV",{},["A",{"href":"/","class":"brand brand-footer","aria-label":"Roadmap home"},["SPAN",{"class":"brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"R"],["SPAN",{},"Roadmap"]],["P",{},"Coach-branded golf development roadmaps."]],["DIV",{"class":"footer-note"},["P",{},"For independent golf instructors across Canada."],["P",{},"Roadmap is a working product name."]],["NA